<title>JAPAN: Japan Feb platinum imports down 23.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Feb platinum imports down 23.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's platinum imports in February were down 23.4 percent from a year earlier to 5.20 tonnes, Finance Ministry data released on Friday showed.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     Feb 97    Jan 97    Feb 96</p>
<p> Total	     5.20	 7.10	 6.79</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> South Africa    4.07	 3.98	 3.01</p>
<p> Russia	    nil	  1.17	 2.96</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first two months of 1997 totalled 12.29 tonnes, up from 11.12 tonnes the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk (+81-3-3432-7391)</p>
</text>
